'' RUN: a VIRTUAL method and a virtual property returning a UDT with a destructor, used as a DIM
'' initialiser, an assignment, through a byref base parameter, dispatched to an override, as a
'' temporary, as a byval argument and discarded. The DIM was an internal compiler error (TKO0994)
'' and the assignment invalid IR. Expected: fbc's output for the same program, lifetimes included.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/virtual-udt-return.tiko -o tests/codegen/virtualudtreturn.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/virtualudtreturn.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/virtualudtreturn.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 242
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: animal 1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: animal 2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 3 animal
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: animal:5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: aprop 7
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: dog 101
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: dog 102
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 103 dog
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: dog:105
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: dprop 70
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: made 20 copied 20 destroyed 40
